<title>NETHERLANDS: Neways 1996 net profit edges higher.</title>
<headline>Neways 1996 net profit edges higher.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to end December</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.42 vs   1.52</p>
<p>    Net profit			     6.31 vs   6.06</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  0.35 vs   0.35</p>
<p>    Turnover			     236.4  vs 150.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Neways Electronics International.</p>
